@namespace PEMS.UI.Components
@attribute [PEMS.UI.Rendering.PemsComponent("kpi-tile", Category = "display", Icon = "bi-speedometer2")]
@if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Options.Href))
{
    <a class="@Css" href="@Options.Href" title="@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(Options.Hint) ? null : Options.Hint)" @attributes="Options.Attributes">@Body</a>
}
else
{
    <div class="@Css" title="@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(Options.Hint) ? null : Options.Hint)" @attributes="Options.Attributes">@Body</div>
}
@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public KpiTileOptions Options { get; set; } = default!;
    /// <summary>The value markup (a count, a decimal, "42 &lt;small&gt;%&lt;/small&gt;").</summary>
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
    /// <summary>True when the page wrote no value: a dash shows.</summary>
    [Parameter] public bool Empty { get; set; }
    private string Css
    {
        get
        {
            var css = string.IsNullOrEmpty(Options.Href) ? "kpi-card" : "kpi-card kpi-link text-decoration-none";
            if (Options.Compact) css += " kpi-card--compact";
            return string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Options.CssClass) ? css : css + " " + Options.CssClass.Trim();
        }
    }
    private string ValueCss => Options.Tone is "danger" or "success" or "warning" ? "kpi-value text-" + Options.Tone : "kpi-value";
    private RenderFragment Body => b =>
    {
        if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Options.Icon))
        {
            b.OpenElement(0, "div");
            b.AddAttribute(1, "class", "kpi-icon " + Options.IconClass);
            b.OpenElement(2, "i");
            b.AddAttribute(3, "aria-hidden", "true");
            b.AddAttribute(4, "class", "bi " + Options.Icon);
            b.CloseElement();
            b.CloseElement();
        }
        b.OpenElement(5, "div");
        b.OpenElement(6, "div");
        b.AddAttribute(7, "class", ValueCss);
        if (Empty || ChildContent is null) b.AddContent(8, "-"); else b.AddContent(9, ChildContent);
        b.CloseElement();
        b.OpenElement(10, "div");
        b.AddAttribute(11, "class", "kpi-label");
        b.AddContent(12, Options.Label);
        b.CloseElement();
        if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Options.Sub))
        {
            b.OpenElement(13, "div");
            b.AddAttribute(14, "class", "kpi-sub");
            b.AddContent(15, Options.Sub);
            b.CloseElement();
        }
        b.CloseElement();
    };
}
